<p>HAI NABI SE MOHABBAT KA DAWA JISE<br />
UNKI AWLAD SE DUSHMANI CHHODH DE<br />
GAR SHAFA&rsquo;AT PAIYAMBAR SE DARKAR HAI<br />
UNKE AGYAAR KI DOSTI CHHODH DE</p>

<p>ZILLATO MA&rsquo;ZERAT MASIYAT KE SEWA<br />
DAMAN-E-GHAIR MEIN AUR KUCH BHI NAHI<br />
UNKE SAAYE SE DARR UNSE BACH KAR NIKAL<br />
NOOR-E-IMAAN MEIN AA GUMRAHI CHHODH DE</p>

<p>APNE RAB SE BAZAAHIR TO DARTA HAI TU<br />
LAMBI LAMBI NAMAZEIN BHI PADHTA HAI TU<br />
AUR KHAAMI NAHI KOI TUJH MEIN BADI <br />
KHAHISHE NAFS KI PAIRWI CHHODH DE</p>

<p>DEEN-E-HAQ KO ZARURAT JO SACHCHON KI THI<br />
SAR PE BAANDHE KAFAN AA GAYE PANJATAN<br />
AISE SACHCHON KI TAKZEEB KARTA HO JO<br />
CHAHIYE USKO DEENE NABI CHHODH DE</p>

<p>TUNE BAKKHIN KAHA MARHABA MARHABA<br />
KEH DIYA THA TO PHIR USSE PHIR KYON GAYA<br />
JO KAHA KAR USE PHIR NIBHAYA BHI KAR<br />
GAR MUNAFIQ NAHI DO RUKHI CHHODH DE</p>

<p>NAJDIYAT KHARJIYAT KI AWLAAD HAI<br />
NAFRATO ASBIYAT INTESHAARO NIFAAQ<br />
AMN QAYEM ZAMAANE MEIN HO JAAYEGA<br />
AALE ATHAAR SE DUSHMANI CHHOD DE</p>

<p>HAI JO TUJH PAR GIRAAN NAAM-E-MUSHKIL KUSHA<br />
TU JO MUNKIR HADEES-E-KISA KA HUWA<br />
YUN TO DEEN-E-MOHAMMAD SE BAAHAR HAI TU<br />
KAM SE KAM NISBAT-E-JAFARI CHHODH DE</p>

<p>KHARJI NAASBI MARHABI ANTARI <br />
MUTTAHID HO KE AAYE MUQAABIL TERE<br />
BADH KE MISLE KHUMAINI UNHE ROK DE<br />
WARNA PHIR NARA-E-HAIDERI CHHOD DE</p>

<p>JO DOSTDARE NABIYO ALI HAIN WAHI<br />
APNE KIRDAR SE BHI JO SAABIT KARE<br />
KYON WO KEHTA HAI JO KHUD BI KARTA NAHI<br />
LEADARI CHHOD YA REHZANI CHHOD DE</p>

<p>CHUGHLIYAAN GHEEBATEIN BUGZO KEENA HASAD<br />
TOHMATO ITTEHAAMO NIFAAQO RIYA<br />
JO BURI AADATEIN HAIN SABHI CHHOD DE<br />
CHHOD DE CHHOD DE AUR ABHI CHHOD DE</p>

<p>TERE NAZDEEK KIRDAR KUCH BHI NAHI<br />
TU FAQAT MARDE GUFTAAR HAI WAYEZA<br />
KHUD AMAL KARKE AURON KO TALQEEN KAR<br />
WARZA LAFFAZI-O-ZAKIRI CHHOD DE</p>

<p>HUM TO NAAT-O-SANA MARSIYE KE SIWA<br />
SHAAYERI KUCH NAHI JEE KA JANJAAL HAI<br />
HAI YE TERE LIYE BHI MAZARRAT RASAAN<br />
AB MERI MAAN LE SHAAYERI CHHOD DE</p>

<p>AAP APNE GAREBAAN BHI JHAANK LE<br />
APNI ISLAAH KAR SAB SUDHAR JAAYENGE<br />
SIRF BATEIN NA KAR, SIBTE JAFAR NA BAN<br />
BAD ZABAANI SE BACH BADZANI CHHOD DE</p>
